1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,342
Then I took one.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,057
But coming back was
harder than leaving.

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,436
My experience still fit.

4
00:00:06,466 --> 00:00:08,932
One gap was real,
so I worked on it.

5
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,210
A pause isn't a full stop.

